        # grlib_sync_reset_enable_all=1 (the config every PASSING sim uses)
        # instead of the stock minimal-reset config.  sc-to-DDR3 fails 0/N on
        # HW at both 40 and 24 MHz while all RTL sims pass -- the reset-config
        # split between sim and synth is the prime remaining suspect (busif5x
        # lr_valid / cctrl amo state under minimal reset).  If this fixes sc on
        # HW, keep it (FPGA flows commonly enable full sync reset) -- else
        # revert to "@grlib//third_party/grlib:config_vhd_file".
